# No HTML title attributes

Never use the HTML `title` attribute for hover text, hints, or accessibility. Use the existing `Tooltip` component from `src/components/Tooltip.tsx`, and keep a real `aria-label` (or visible text) on the control.

This does **not** ban React props named `title` (for example `title={editTitle}` on a task modal).

```tsx
// BAD
<button title="Drag to reorder" aria-label="Reorder task" />

// GOOD
<Tooltip label="Drag to reorder" placement="top">
  <button type="button" aria-label="Reorder task" />
</Tooltip>
```
